  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"MGcy1\" id=\"MGcy1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufaefb1c4\" id=\"ufaefb1c4\">树莓派 Zero 2 W 自动断网回退 WiFi 热点配置指南</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uaddcfc7e\" id=\"uaddcfc7e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01846de9\" id=\"u01846de9\">本指南基于 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubfc1110a\" id=\"ubfc1110a\">NetworkManager</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc5ad5dc0\" id=\"uc5ad5dc0\"> 实现。当树莓派开机无法连接已知 WiFi 时，会自动拉起一个纯 WiFi 热点（AP 模式），方便通过固定 IP（192.168.4.1）进行无线 SSH 调试。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"sIAAk\" id=\"sIAAk\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a2b8465\" id=\"u3a2b8465\">一、环境准备与冲突清理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ubf203dfc\" id=\"ubf203dfc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e166a3c\" id=\"u5e166a3c\">NetworkManager 的热点共享模式（</span><code data-lake-id=\"ube7c95e9\" id=\"ube7c95e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ef9e8fd\" id=\"u7ef9e8fd\">shared</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2e10e6bd\" id=\"u2e10e6bd\">）会在后台自动调用微型 DHCP 服务。为了防止系统原生服务与之冲突导致热点“秒退”，需要先安装依赖并清理冲突端口。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf394eeca\" id=\"uf394eeca\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6a71a147\" id=\"u6a71a147\">安装必要组件</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u268fef19\" id=\"u268fef19\">（确保可以进行 IP 分配和转发）：</span></p><ol list=\"ua25257ee\"><li fid=\"u40caec7a\" data-lake-id=\"u09a05cac\" id=\"u09a05cac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c0074e5\" id=\"u4c0074e5\">Bash</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20apt%20update%5Cnsudo%20apt%20install%20dnsmasq-base%20iptables%20-y%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22il2yz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u99f4937e\" id=\"u99f4937e\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u6ba46914\" id=\"u6ba46914\">注意：只需安装 </span></em><code data-lake-id=\"u6a84faf1\" id=\"u6a84faf1\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u0b247b6b\" id=\"u0b247b6b\">dnsmasq-base</span></em></code><em><span data-lake-id=\"ua8af1b9c\" id=\"ua8af1b9c\"> 底层组件，切勿安装完整的 </span></em><code data-lake-id=\"u48e80abf\" id=\"u48e80abf\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u706ecaef\" id=\"u706ecaef\">dnsmasq</span></em></code><em><span data-lake-id=\"ueca4a6ac\" id=\"ueca4a6ac\"> 服务。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc044cad8\" id=\"uc044cad8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua2957a62\" id=\"ua2957a62\">禁用独立的 dnsmasq 服务</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubc9652d1\" id=\"ubc9652d1\">（防止其占用 53/67 端口导致 IP 冲突）：</span></p><ol list=\"ua25257ee\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u40caec7a\" data-lake-id=\"u82f66618\" id=\"u82f66618\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52bbd342\" id=\"u52bbd342\">Bash</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20systemctl%20stop%20dnsmasq%5Cnsudo%20systemctl%20disable%20dnsmasq%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gHXzz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"ggcyf\" id=\"ggcyf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5bc748b\" id=\"uf5bc748b\">二、创建 WiFi 热点配置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ubeb9d917\" id=\"ubeb9d917\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33f6d89b\" id=\"u33f6d89b\">使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ufcb59c3c\" id=\"ufcb59c3c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4fa9659b\" id=\"u4fa9659b\">nmcli</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubebceccb\" id=\"ubebceccb\"> 创建一个专用的热点连接文件，并将其绑定在固定的频段和信道上，以提高无线稳定性。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8184bc90\" id=\"u8184bc90\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud27ee8d9\" id=\"ud27ee8d9\">Bash</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%201.%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%BA%20%5C%22Heima_Hotspot%5C%22%20%E7%9A%84%E7%83%AD%E7%82%B9%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%8CSSID%20%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E4%B8%BA%20%5C%22Heima_AP%5C%22%5Cnsudo%20nmcli%20con%20add%20type%20wifi%20ifname%20wlan0%20mode%20ap%20con-name%20%5C%22Heima_Hotspot%5C%22%20ssid%20%5C%22Heima_AP%5C%22%20autoconnect%20false%5Cn%5Cn%23%202.%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%83%AD%E7%82%B9%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%E3%80%81IP%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%88192.168.4.1%EF%BC%89%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%5Cnsudo%20nmcli%20con%20modify%20%5C%22Heima_Hotspot%5C%22%20wifi-sec.key-mgmt%20wpa-psk%20wifi-sec.psk%20%5C%2212345678%5C%22%20ipv4.method%20shared%20ipv4.addresses%20192.168.4.1%2F24%5Cn%5Cn%23%203.%20%E9%94%81%E5%AE%9A%E9%A2%91%E6%AE%B5%E5%92%8C%E4%BF%A1%E9%81%93%EF%BC%882.4G%20%E9%A2%91%E6%AE%B5%EF%BC%8C%E4%BF%A1%E9%81%93%206%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E7%BD%91%E5%8D%A1%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%E8%B7%B3%E9%A2%91%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%5Cnsudo%20nmcli%20con%20modify%20%5C%22Heima_Hotspot%5C%22%20wifi.band%20bg%20wifi.channel%206%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yIDt0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"GhJdJ\" id=\"GhJdJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5c3fad2\" id=\"ue5c3fad2\">三、编写状态监控与自动切换脚本</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf59b8f50\" id=\"uf59b8f50\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d3ffebc\" id=\"u9d3ffebc\">创建自动化检测脚本。脚本利用严格的正则匹配，精准判断 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u03d204a3\" id=\"u03d204a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10587000\" id=\"u10587000\">wlan0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2401b9d4\" id=\"u2401b9d4\"> 的连接状态，避免被 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud6cf0ea9\" id=\"ud6cf0ea9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30a8b236\" id=\"u30a8b236\">disconnected</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u835deb23\" id=\"u835deb23\"> 状态字符误导。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3b108e45\" id=\"u3b108e45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08d8b54d\" id=\"u08d8b54d\">创建脚本文件：</span></p><ol list=\"u740fc48b\"><li fid=\"ue2b7ec40\" data-lake-id=\"u3d807c86\" id=\"u3d807c86\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c3b2cb5\" id=\"u5c3b2cb5\">Bash</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20nano%20%2Fusr%2Flocal%2Fbin%2Fwifi_monitor.sh%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nDgko%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua8f76ee1\" id=\"ua8f76ee1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2c043a6\" id=\"ua2c043a6\">写入以下内容：</span></p><ol list=\"u740fc48b\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ue2b7ec40\" data-lake-id=\"ue4ba2442\" id=\"ue4ba2442\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1e5400d\" id=\"uf1e5400d\">Bash</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23!%2Fbin%2Fbash%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%90%8E%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%2015%20%E7%A7%92%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%99%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%85%85%E8%B6%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%9