1a49b97\" id=\"u51a49b97\">Ini, TOML</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5BUnit%5D%5CnDescription%3DAuto%20Switch%20to%20WiFi%20Hotspot%20if%20disconnected%5CnAfter%3Dnetwork.target%20NetworkManager.service%5CnWants%3Dnetwork.target%5Cn%5Cn%5BService%5D%5CnType%3Doneshot%5CnExecStart%3D%2Fusr%2Flocal%2Fbin%2Fwifi_monitor.sh%5Cn%5Cn%5BInstall%5D%5CnWantedBy%3Dmulti-user.target%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HzUDw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9eb07783\" id=\"u9eb07783\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue207fa84\" id=\"ue207fa84\">重新加载系统服务并开启自启使能：</span></p><ol list=\"u70ddadd8\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u3b423230\" data-lake-id=\"uc1e0cc10\" id=\"uc1e0cc10\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02f5df17\" id=\"u02f5df17\">Bash</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20systemctl%20daemon-reload%5Cnsudo%20systemctl%20enable%20autohotspot.service%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zCUDn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"aYt5j\" id=\"aYt5j\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10e5a457\" id=\"u10e5a457\">五、日常使用与测试验证</span></h2><ul list=\"u23d324c8\"><li fid=\"u0e8ae1c7\" data-lake-id=\"u91a47bcc\" id=\"u91a47bcc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2b5388d\" id=\"ub2b5388d\">常规模式</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5a29bd86\" id=\"u5a29bd86\">：树莓派处于已知 WiFi 环境下开机，会正常连接路由器，监控脚本检测到连接后自动退出，不干扰正常网络。</span></li><li fid=\"u0e8ae1c7\" data-lake-id=\"u4fddaab1\" id=\"u4fddaab1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u395e82a5\" id=\"u395e82a5\">回退热点模式</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8c76079e\" id=\"u8c76079e\">：树莓派在户外或无已知 WiFi 环境下开机，开机约 15~20 秒后，网卡会自动广播出名为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u250fdcb2\" id=\"u250fdcb2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39ecf3ec\" id=\"u39ecf3ec\">Heima_AP</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u16b064d9\" id=\"u16b064d9\"> 的热点。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u12d9a9ae\" id=\"u12d9a9ae\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u43c6d0ac\" id=\"u43c6d0ac\">无线连入调试</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud9e5c19b\" id=\"ud9e5c19b\">：电脑或手机连接该热点（密码 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc5037648\" id=\"uc5037648\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78e5adea\" id=\"u78e5adea\">12345678</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uebcef9e5\" id=\"uebcef9e5\">），即可通过固定终端地址进行本地控制：</span></p><ul list=\"u23d324c8\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u0e8ae1c7\" data-lake-id=\"u01009373\" id=\"u01009373\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2630835a\" id=\"u2630835a\">Bash</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ssh%20xkj%40192.168.4.1%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gIibt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
